  "id": "alcohol-withdrawal",
  "term": "alcohol withdrawal",
  "definition": "Alcohol withdrawal is a set of physical and psychiatric problems that can occur in people with alcohol dependence. It is a distinct alcohol-related condition that may present with medical complications and needs to be distinguished from alcohol dependence itself and from alcohol dependence with anxiety.",
